# Human Prion Protein (PrP) — Sample AAF File
# AAF v1.0 | arbudadhā Project
# Source: UniProt P04156 (PRIO_HUMAN), residues 23-253

@chain A
@organism human
@type prion
@name Human Prion Protein PrP
@length 60

SEQ:
M K H M A G A A A A G A V V G G L G G Y M L G S A M S R P I
I H F G S D Y E D R Y Y R E N M H R Y P N Q V Y Y R P V D Q

HINT:
1-6   COIL    # N-terminal unstructured region
7-14  ALPHA   # Helix 1 (H1)
15-22 BETA    # Beta strand S1 — critical in PrPSc conversion
23-28 GAMMA   # Gamma turn connecting S1 to S2
29-38 BETA    # Beta strand S2 — sheets form here in misfolded state
39-50 ALPHA   # Helix 2 (H2) — large central helix in PrPc
51-60 COIL    # C-terminal flexible loop
